785		// "unhealthy" report keeps its accepted observation: the rejections state
786		// the reason and the accepted sequence, and the instance stays in the
787		// candidate set. The rejected reports target b, the instance the rotation
788		// would choose next; the cursor must neither skip it nor restart.
